{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05691","headline":"题豫章馆 · 崔国辅","name":"题豫章馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杨柳映春江，江南转佳丽。\n吴门绿波里，越国青山际。\n游宦常往来，津亭暂临憩。\n驿前苍石没，浦外湖沙细。\n向晚宴且久，孤舟冏然逝。\n云留西北客，气歇东南帝。\n独有萋萋心，谁知怨芳岁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔国辅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05691.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05691","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}